  (text "U2: internal 10k pullups; RTC/OLED modules also contain pullups.\nKeep the RTC module 5 V pullups on the HIGH side only.\nU2 isolates the bus if either supply is absent.\nConfirm rise time and low level on populated hardware."
    (at 20.32 144.78 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid b9d09546-7de6-517c-8079-879a7e92c6f5))
  (text "CR2032 IS NOT RECHARGEABLE.\nDisable and verify the Tiny RTC charging path BEFORE fitting cell.\nVerify DS1307 VBAT = 2.0..3.5 V and remove any incompatible\nbattery divider after checking the exact module traces.\nDo not copy component designators from a different Tiny RTC revision."
    (at 20.32 177.8 0)
    (effects
